play intro
loop A A2 B B2 A A2 A+1 A2+1

# Boss section: the police helicopter. The bass chops into rotor sixteenths under a tom rotor, the hook turns
# G Phrygian (A flat) over Gm / Ab, orchestra hits land in base and the siren wails every other bar; in Y the hook climbs.
pattern X
bell  | G5--- D5- G5- A#5--- G#5- G5- | C6------- A#5- G#5- G5- D#5- | G5--- D5- G5- A#5--- C6- D6- | F#5------- A5- C6- D6- F#5- |
